  "implementation_notes": [
    "Full Oracle and XMage card/helpers read. StaticFilters controlled-another-creature declaration and CardUtil return lookup inspected as utility sections.",
    "CR110.2a returns under the triggered ability controller, preserving owner. CR400.7e binds only the exact graveyard incarnation. Creature qualification is frozen predeath; later artifact deaths do not trigger.",
    "CR611.2e requires artifact-only continuous typing as the nontoken enters, unlike XMage post-entry application. CR205.1a replaces prior card types, retaining exceptional instant/sorcery types; subtypes correlate with final layer-four card types. Supertypes/colors/abilities remain. Permanent noncopiable form clears on departure.",
    "Sacrifice current power is captured at additional-cost commitment in the existing owned packet, independently of resolution choices. Negative power draws zero; discard remains mandatory."
  ]
